WEBVTT

00:02:59.076 --> 00:03:01.196
is written on our hearts.

00:03:01.916 --> 00:03:06.716
Fear and grief, for example,
can cause profound cardiac injury.

00:03:06.716 --> 00:03:11.196
The nerves that control unconscious
processes such as the heartbeat

00:03:11.196 --> 00:03:13.036
can sense distress

00:03:13.036 --> 00:03:17.996
and trigger a maladaptive
fight-or-flight response

00:03:17.996 --> 00:03:21.516
that triggers blood vessels to constrict,

00:03:21.516 --> 00:03:23.276
the heart to gallop

00:03:23.276 --> 00:03:25.876
and blood pressure to rise,

00:03:25.876 --> 00:03:27.636
resulting in damage.

00:03:27.676 --> 00:03:29.436
In other words,

00:03:29.436 --> 00:03:32.076
it is increasingly clear